WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.830
=Episode 35=

01:32.979 --> 01:34.850
(Xiao Zhongwu, Song Wan)
Father, Mother.

01:35.220 --> 01:37.060
I cannot abandon the Xiao Army.

01:39.060 --> 01:40.620
Nor can I be her obstacle.

01:43.060 --> 01:45.259
If we're not destined to be a couple,

01:49.100 --> 01:50.180
then I'd rather be

01:51.700 --> 01:52.860
single and alone.

01:56.720 --> 02:02.370
(Virtues' Enduring Legacy)

02:06.460 --> 02:07.300
Your Majesty.

02:07.420 --> 02:08.259
Shall I

02:08.340 --> 02:09.740
change it with fresh flowers?

02:19.380 --> 02:21.820
I ruined Xiao Jue and He Yan's marriage.

02:22.579 --> 02:23.420
They

02:25.140 --> 02:27.140
must hold resentment toward me.

02:27.940 --> 02:28.900
I suppose

02:29.180 --> 02:31.540
you have your reasons, Your Majesty.

02:32.340 --> 02:34.220
The imperial court requires

02:35.540 --> 02:37.980
a balance.

02:39.100 --> 02:39.940
But now,

02:40.380 --> 02:42.380
two powerful generals

02:43.780 --> 02:45.020
seek to unite.

02:46.260 --> 02:47.140
How could I

02:48.380 --> 02:50.700
rest easy with this?

02:51.860 --> 02:54.820
Their grievances were predictable.

02:58.579 --> 02:59.660
Since that's the case,

03:03.300 --> 03:04.140
I shall

03:04.340 --> 03:06.220
make their division

03:06.980 --> 03:08.660
more absolute.

03:14.180 --> 03:15.020
Your Majesty,

03:15.420 --> 03:17.060
General Fengyun requests an audience.

03:26.290 --> 03:29.980
(Xiao Mansion)

03:31.220 --> 03:33.260
Your wedding gown
was rushed to completion.

03:33.300 --> 03:34.220
It just arrived.

03:35.460 --> 03:36.579
Quickly try it on.

03:36.820 --> 03:37.820
If it doesn't fit,

03:37.860 --> 03:38.700
we'll alter it.

03:40.460 --> 03:41.300
Come on.

03:42.100 --> 03:42.940
Come.

03:45.300 --> 03:46.420
The embroidery and fabric

03:46.460 --> 03:47.540
are truly first-rate.

03:48.140 --> 03:49.100
Huaijin is thoughtful.

03:54.860 --> 03:56.420
But this dress looks so complicated.

03:57.180 --> 03:58.060
How do I wear it?

03:59.660 --> 04:00.500
Don't worry.

04:00.540 --> 04:01.380
We'll help you.

04:01.540 --> 04:02.380
Go try it.

04:16.339 --> 04:17.540
Miss He looks stunning.

04:18.579 --> 04:19.940
Huaijin chose well.

04:20.380 --> 04:21.700
In Yaojing, these past years,

04:21.940 --> 04:22.900
no bride's gown

04:23.540 --> 04:24.380
could compare to

04:24.860 --> 04:26.900
what you're wearing now.

04:29.580 --> 04:30.740
Truly magnificent.

04:33.260 --> 04:34.100
Rongwei.

04:34.140 --> 04:34.980
Miss He.

04:35.500 --> 04:36.340
Huaijin has returned.

04:37.620 --> 04:39.340
Let him try his attire alone.

04:39.340 --> 04:40.180
Right now,

04:40.180 --> 04:42.780
he shouldn't see
the bride's full ensemble.

04:45.540 --> 04:47.060
He's returned with an imperial edict.

04:58.380 --> 04:59.220
Xiao Jue.

05:05.540 --> 05:06.580
Is anything wrong?

05:08.740 --> 05:09.780
He Yan, heed the decree.

05:17.460 --> 05:18.980
His Majesty

05:19.980 --> 05:20.820
decrees that

05:21.340 --> 05:22.180
He Yan,

05:22.300 --> 05:23.260
a scholar and warrior,

05:23.660 --> 05:24.580
has done great feats,

05:25.220 --> 05:26.060
protecting Jiyang,

05:26.300 --> 05:27.140
defending Rundu,

05:27.740 --> 05:28.860
and repelling Wutuo.

05:29.500 --> 05:30.580
For her contributions,

05:31.300 --> 05:33.620
she is granted
the Mansion of General Feihong.

05:35.020 --> 05:37.500
May she continue
exceeding my expectations

05:37.940 --> 05:39.060
with tireless dedication

05:39.780 --> 05:40.980
and loyalty.

05:48.140 --> 05:49.340
- Thank...
- Another edict.

06:02.940 --> 06:04.500
General Feihong,

06:05.380 --> 06:06.220
He Yan,

06:07.420 --> 06:08.620
has noble character

06:09.100 --> 06:10.180
and dual expertise.

06:12.100 --> 06:13.900
Lord Shijin's son,

06:14.940 --> 06:15.940
Chu Zhao, Vice Director

06:16.580 --> 06:17.420
of the Secretariat,

06:18.100 --> 06:19.260
has honorable bearing

06:20.540 --> 06:21.860
and exceptional talent.

06:22.940 --> 06:23.780
They are

06:24.860 --> 06:26.220
a most fitting match.

06:27.260 --> 06:28.260
By imperial decree,

06:28.740 --> 06:29.980
the two shall wed

06:32.060 --> 06:33.260
(Imperial Edict)
on a day

06:34.060 --> 06:34.900
of good fortune.

06:38.659 --> 06:39.620
That's all.

06:43.380 --> 06:44.740
He Yan narrowly escaped death

06:45.420 --> 06:47.620
to reclaim the General Feihong title.

06:48.820 --> 06:50.020
Forcing her to abandon it

06:51.020 --> 06:51.860
would erase

06:52.340 --> 06:53.260
her very essence.

06:54.980 --> 06:55.900
The Xiao Army

06:57.300 --> 06:59.180
is my father's life's work

07:00.580 --> 07:01.980
and remains my duty.

07:03.020 --> 07:04.220
Let me let go.

07:05.460 --> 07:06.340
Then I

07:07.620 --> 07:08.860
cannot remain myself.

07:11.220 --> 07:12.060
It seems

07:13.180 --> 07:14.620
you've made your choice.

07:15.860 --> 07:17.980
You left me no other choice.

07:20.700 --> 07:23.020
I shall have you perform another task.

07:23.700 --> 07:24.940
This marriage decree.

07:26.620 --> 07:27.940
You shall personally deliver.

07:37.260 --> 07:38.100
No,

07:40.140 --> 07:40.980
I won't.

07:41.460 --> 07:42.540
You are defying my order?

07:50.020 --> 07:51.100
Please

07:52.420 --> 07:53.500
punish me.

07:53.620 --> 07:54.460
You...

08:18.140 --> 08:19.340
Aren't you afraid of

08:20.540 --> 08:21.940
dragging down your family?

08:34.539 --> 08:35.780
If that's your order,

08:38.940 --> 08:40.380
I obey.

08:54.260 --> 08:55.100
What did you say?

08:58.820 --> 09:00.180
Repeat that.

09:09.180 --> 09:10.700
You broke plum branches

09:12.820 --> 09:14.220
and made bridal attire for me.

09:16.620 --> 09:17.540
In the end,

09:20.060 --> 09:21.780
you want me to marry someone else.

09:23.330 --> 09:28.510
♪Walking through the crowd,
without asking about the future♪

09:30.520 --> 09:34.400
♪Wandering half a lifetime,
solitary as the moon♪

09:35.020 --> 09:36.580
If that's the case,

09:37.900 --> 09:38.740
I...

09:40.740 --> 09:41.700
accept...

09:46.220 --> 09:47.140
and give thanks.

09:51.600 --> 09:56.320
♪Just to see you turn,
a fleeting blush in your glance♪

09:58.660 --> 10:04.260
♪Just to tread the snow you described♪

10:05.140 --> 10:08.700
♪The more fate intertwines intensely♪

10:08.700 --> 10:11.770
♪The further we drift apart♪

10:11.920 --> 10:18.610
♪It's hard to sever love or hatred♪

10:19.250 --> 10:22.730
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

10:22.750 --> 10:25.370
♪Again and again♪

10:26.320 --> 10:32.030
♪My love rests between your fingers♪

10:32.720 --> 10:36.670
♪Farewell tears blur my vision♪

10:36.670 --> 10:39.700
♪Indescribable yearnings♪

10:39.700 --> 10:40.900
General Fengyun,

10:42.580 --> 10:43.940
why won't you let go?

10:51.540 --> 10:52.820
How else should I

10:54.300 --> 10:55.820
accept this decree gratefully?

11:01.430 --> 11:05.120
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

11:05.150 --> 11:07.740
♪Again and again♪

11:08.660 --> 11:14.370
♪My love for you burns fiercely♪

11:15.030 --> 11:18.880
♪Lifelong devotion turns into a vow♪

11:18.880 --> 11:22.110
♪That's my last wish♪

11:23.110 --> 11:29.160
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

11:37.860 --> 11:39.100
(As the General Feihong,)

11:39.980 --> 11:41.380
you must soar freely

11:42.740 --> 11:44.020
in the sky.

12:03.380 --> 12:05.060
The Emperor

12:05.220 --> 12:08.540
summons General Feihong to the palace.

12:21.300 --> 12:24.830
(Devoted to Duty, Open to Counsel)

12:27.860 --> 12:28.700
This is He Yan.

12:29.060 --> 12:29.900
Your Majesty.

12:30.620 --> 12:31.460
At ease.

12:36.820 --> 12:37.660
Miss He,

12:38.940 --> 12:41.420
I know you and Mr. Xiao
share mutual affection.

12:41.820 --> 12:42.660
But

12:43.260 --> 12:45.380
Mr. Chu is also an outstanding talent.

12:45.660 --> 12:47.700
He'll soon rise
to first-rank official status.

12:49.860 --> 12:50.700
Your Majesty,

12:50.940 --> 12:51.860
however great he is,

12:52.460 --> 12:53.500
it is irrelevant to me.

12:53.820 --> 12:54.860
I come today

12:56.300 --> 12:58.460
to request you to revoke that decree.

13:08.380 --> 13:09.220
Your Majesty.

13:09.820 --> 13:10.660
At ease.

13:11.220 --> 13:12.060
Perfect timing.

13:12.780 --> 13:14.420
She wants me to retract my decree,

13:15.860 --> 13:17.420
but it's inappropriate.

13:18.660 --> 13:19.500
Your Majesty,

13:20.100 --> 13:21.780
I will cherish He Yan wholeheartedly

13:22.300 --> 13:23.940
and make her understand my sincerity.

13:24.180 --> 13:25.020
Given time...

13:25.020 --> 13:26.020
This is unnecessary.

13:29.260 --> 13:30.100
Your Majesty,

13:30.500 --> 13:31.340
I know

13:32.180 --> 13:33.420
you just want to prevent

13:33.900 --> 13:35.780
a marriage between two military leaders.

13:37.980 --> 13:39.580
I won't marry Xiao Jue.

13:42.340 --> 13:43.180
But

13:43.300 --> 13:44.500
I won't marry Chu Zhao either.

13:45.820 --> 13:46.660
Outrageous!

13:49.900 --> 13:50.940
Please calm your anger.

13:51.580 --> 13:52.420
I

13:52.620 --> 13:53.540
won't defy the decree,

13:55.900 --> 13:57.020
but I refuse to settle.

13:57.940 --> 14:00.060
If I can't spend my life
with the one I love,

14:01.180 --> 14:02.180
I would rather

14:02.940 --> 14:04.060
remain alone forever.

14:08.180 --> 14:09.620
Please grant me.

14:13.980 --> 14:14.820
Your Majesty,

14:17.900 --> 14:18.860
if He Yan

14:19.620 --> 14:20.940
refuses to marry Chu Zhao,

14:23.380 --> 14:24.540
I implore you

14:26.580 --> 14:27.900
to grant her

14:29.180 --> 14:30.740
a choice.

14:42.460 --> 14:43.300
Fine.

14:46.700 --> 14:48.140
Have it your way.

14:58.500 --> 14:59.340
I shall

14:59.620 --> 15:00.460
take my leave.

15:15.620 --> 15:16.460
(Have I)

15:17.380 --> 15:19.180
(truly erred?)

15:24.860 --> 15:25.820
Were you involved in

15:27.580 --> 15:28.580
this arranged marriage?

15:31.980 --> 15:32.820
Yes.

15:34.660 --> 15:35.620
I requested it.

15:37.100 --> 15:39.900
But Xiao Jue still dumped you.

15:44.460 --> 15:45.780
You're an intelligent man.

15:46.780 --> 15:48.020
You should understand

15:48.620 --> 15:50.460
that decree cannot constrain me.

15:51.180 --> 15:52.260
We were never

15:53.980 --> 15:55.420
in the cards.

15:56.700 --> 15:57.700
There's no future

15:58.260 --> 15:59.540
for you two.

16:00.780 --> 16:02.100
Why not turn your eyes to me?

16:02.380 --> 16:03.220
Can you not tell

16:03.220 --> 16:04.580
my heart is as true as his?

16:04.620 --> 16:05.700
That's not love.

16:07.220 --> 16:08.900
It was all a calculated game.

16:13.460 --> 16:14.780
Should I cut open my heart?

16:14.940 --> 16:17.140
Is a calculated heart any less worthy?

16:17.420 --> 16:18.260
Tell me!

16:18.660 --> 16:19.500
You're insane!

16:21.100 --> 16:22.780
How much ambition is hidden

16:24.780 --> 16:26.620
behind the love you speak of?

16:27.220 --> 16:28.620
Was every single thing you did

16:29.180 --> 16:31.060
truly only for me?

16:31.580 --> 16:33.860
Stop deluding yourself, Chu Zhao.

16:35.540 --> 16:36.380
I'm just

16:37.980 --> 16:40.540
a pretty excuse for your ambition.

17:01.500 --> 17:02.340
You know what?

17:03.260 --> 17:05.700
You're becoming another Xu Jingfu.

17:56.340 --> 17:59.420
(Chu Mansion)

18:00.980 --> 18:02.660
Miss Xu, your meal is served.

18:03.460 --> 18:04.820
Chu Zhao had you send these

18:05.580 --> 18:06.740
for me to eat?

18:07.220 --> 18:08.700
You're overthinking, Miss Xu.

18:08.940 --> 18:10.260
Our young master

18:10.420 --> 18:11.260
is extremely busy.

18:11.500 --> 18:12.980
He has no time to care about it.

18:15.300 --> 18:16.420
You wretched maid.

18:16.740 --> 18:17.580
You!

18:17.940 --> 18:19.540
Still acting high and mighty?

18:19.780 --> 18:20.620
Listen up.

18:20.700 --> 18:22.060
His Majesty has decreed

18:22.100 --> 18:23.580
a marriage between our young master

18:23.620 --> 18:24.460
and General Feihong.

18:24.820 --> 18:26.060
Abandon your foolish hopes.

18:26.260 --> 18:27.100
What did you say?

18:27.380 --> 18:29.020
Chu Zhao is marrying He Yan?

18:30.540 --> 18:31.580
Y-Yes.

18:31.860 --> 18:33.180
The news has spread everywhere.

18:42.820 --> 18:43.700
No way.

18:44.460 --> 18:45.300
Chu Zhao,

18:46.540 --> 18:47.900
you won't get your way.

19:01.420 --> 19:02.820
Have you met with Miss He?

19:03.900 --> 19:04.740
How about

19:05.220 --> 19:06.060
your marriage?

19:07.340 --> 19:08.500
There will be no marriage.

19:10.060 --> 19:10.980
Don't bring it up.

19:34.700 --> 19:36.780
I heard about
your imperial marriage decree

19:37.900 --> 19:39.460
and came specially to congratulate you.

19:45.060 --> 19:47.340
Why the haste, Mr. Chu?

19:51.060 --> 19:52.300
I once thought

19:52.860 --> 19:54.980
only fools like me

19:55.740 --> 19:57.300
would cling to unrequited feelings,

19:58.060 --> 19:59.140
be used by others

19:59.780 --> 20:01.820
and then discarded like trash.

20:02.420 --> 20:03.500
I never imagined

20:05.220 --> 20:06.980
that a shrewd man

20:07.100 --> 20:08.980
like you could also

20:10.140 --> 20:12.220
experience unrequited desires.

20:14.940 --> 20:15.780
Miss Xu,

20:16.380 --> 20:17.940
if you continue this outburst,

20:18.220 --> 20:19.700
I'll have to ask you to leave.

20:20.500 --> 20:21.820
If you're done venting,

20:22.180 --> 20:23.380
I'll arrange your return.

20:29.220 --> 20:30.180
Return?

20:32.180 --> 20:33.220
Return where?

20:34.620 --> 20:36.100
You killed my father.

20:36.700 --> 20:38.140
My family home is sealed.

20:39.260 --> 20:41.220
I have neither a home nor a father.

20:41.540 --> 20:43.820
Even the lowest servants
look down on me.

20:44.500 --> 20:45.420
You tell me to return.

20:46.100 --> 20:48.300
Tell me where I should go.

20:49.020 --> 20:50.580
Where should I go? Tell me.

20:50.580 --> 20:51.420
Tell me!

20:54.980 --> 20:55.820
Miss Xu.

20:58.500 --> 20:59.340
What?

21:00.220 --> 21:01.780
You think yourself the greatest victim?

21:02.700 --> 21:04.980
What of those sold into slavery
and forced to grovel?

21:04.980 --> 21:07.220
Or those displaced
and begging on the streets?

21:07.860 --> 21:09.060
Your father's death

21:10.180 --> 21:11.780
was nothing but his deserved punishment.

21:12.260 --> 21:14.980
You still live in luxury.

21:15.300 --> 21:17.660
Only deprived of your former status.

21:19.980 --> 21:20.980
And you're whining now?

21:25.740 --> 21:26.700
You deceived me,

21:27.540 --> 21:28.380
betrayed me,

21:28.940 --> 21:29.780
and dumped me.

21:30.940 --> 21:32.340
But I'd let it all slide.

21:34.780 --> 21:36.980
How could you betray my father?

21:38.980 --> 21:41.500
He may have been a monster to the world,

21:42.420 --> 21:44.660
but he never did you any harm.

21:47.940 --> 21:49.020
In this situation,

21:49.900 --> 21:51.580
you still act superior.

21:53.900 --> 21:55.180
I don't know if this is pitiful

21:56.780 --> 21:57.860
or laughable.

22:02.380 --> 22:03.220
Chu Zhao.

22:30.460 --> 22:31.300
Yingxiang.

22:32.580 --> 22:33.420
Yingxiang.

22:35.700 --> 22:36.540
Ying...

22:37.100 --> 22:37.940
Yingxiang.

22:38.820 --> 22:39.660
Yingxiang.

22:42.900 --> 22:44.580
Guards!

22:44.820 --> 22:45.660
Guards!

22:46.220 --> 22:48.180
Go fetch a physician. Hurry!

22:48.180 --> 22:49.020
Yes.

22:50.740 --> 22:51.580
Yingxiang.

22:52.180 --> 22:53.020
It's okay, Yingxiang.

22:53.020 --> 22:55.140
It's okay. Don't worry, Yingxiang.

22:55.140 --> 22:55.980
You will be okay.

22:56.620 --> 22:57.460
I

22:58.380 --> 22:59.220
don't fear.

23:02.220 --> 23:03.260
I only fear

23:05.060 --> 23:05.940
in the world,

23:08.700 --> 23:10.620
you'll end up alone.

23:16.380 --> 23:17.380
From now on,

23:19.820 --> 23:21.140
stop pushing yourself so hard.

23:25.940 --> 23:26.780
Spare...

23:27.740 --> 23:29.340
Spare yourself.

23:41.540 --> 23:42.380
Chu Zilan.

23:43.180 --> 23:44.300
This is your karma.

23:44.940 --> 23:45.780
Those you love

23:45.820 --> 23:46.780
remain unattainable.

23:47.300 --> 23:48.220
Those who love you

23:49.260 --> 23:50.820
abandon you.

23:51.230 --> 23:53.660
♪Yet I yearn to stand opposed to you♪

23:53.780 --> 23:54.940
This is your karma.

23:56.060 --> 23:56.900
Karma!

23:58.060 --> 23:59.700
This is your karma!

24:02.480 --> 24:05.220
♪Upon towering fortress walls♪

24:05.220 --> 24:08.000
♪Brooding over lamented pasts♪

24:08.000 --> 24:11.010
♪Where shall light be found♪

24:11.010 --> 24:13.090
♪Once♪

24:13.400 --> 24:15.780
♪I had an unbreakable faith♪

24:16.220 --> 24:17.100
Get out!

24:17.220 --> 24:18.060
Listen.

24:18.060 --> 24:19.380
No customers,

24:19.420 --> 24:20.260
no coming back today!

24:20.540 --> 24:22.260
Stop putting on airs like noble ladies!

24:22.300 --> 24:24.220
Did your father even accept you?

24:24.980 --> 24:26.020
I'll teach you a lesson!

24:26.580 --> 24:27.420
Stop!

24:27.900 --> 24:29.780
♪Heartache♪

24:29.780 --> 24:32.830
♪Resenting the lonely years♪

24:33.020 --> 24:33.860
Leave with me.

24:35.190 --> 24:37.310
♪Not let it go♪

24:37.940 --> 24:42.360
♪Tears crystallize to frost♪

24:43.440 --> 24:46.110
♪Clutching stubborn obsessions♪

24:46.110 --> 24:49.590
♪Yet falling into folly♪

24:49.880 --> 24:51.460
♪Fading into oblivion♪

24:51.460 --> 24:54.920
♪Yet memories surge everywhere♪

24:55.640 --> 24:58.050
♪After the separation♪

24:58.450 --> 25:04.710
♪My heart feels adrift♪

25:04.710 --> 25:07.670
(Virtues' Enduring Legacy)

25:07.670 --> 25:10.500
(Ancestral Tablets of the Xiao Clan)

25:35.260 --> 25:36.100
Huaijin,

25:36.740 --> 25:38.140
yesterday, you read the decree

25:38.780 --> 25:40.180
not just under imperial pressure,

25:40.900 --> 25:42.340
but also to shield me and my wife,

25:42.580 --> 25:43.740
and to protect the Xiao Army.

25:44.860 --> 25:46.300
Since childhood, you've shouldered

25:46.820 --> 25:48.660
too much for our family

25:49.620 --> 25:50.540
and me.

25:51.460 --> 25:53.780
Always walking on thin ice
and bearing heavy burdens.

25:54.860 --> 25:56.380
But since Miss He arrived,

25:57.220 --> 25:58.300
you've been a lot brighter

25:59.260 --> 26:00.540
and more open.

26:02.140 --> 26:02.980
As your brother,

26:03.180 --> 26:04.620
I'm deeply grateful to Miss He.

26:10.020 --> 26:10.860
But Huaijin,

26:12.180 --> 26:13.860
you've already given too much.

26:14.820 --> 26:17.220
Don't sacrifice your marriage.

26:17.460 --> 26:19.980
This is unfair to both of you.

26:21.700 --> 26:22.820
Don't overthink it.

26:23.500 --> 26:24.500
No matter what,

26:24.900 --> 26:25.860
we will

26:26.220 --> 26:27.620
always support you.

26:34.620 --> 26:35.940
Why are you still here?

26:36.420 --> 26:37.260
Are you just going

26:37.260 --> 26:38.900
to wait until Miss He marries others?

26:39.180 --> 26:40.020
Can you bear that?

26:52.080 --> 26:55.620
(General Feihong's Mansion)

26:59.760 --> 27:01.500
♪Constant yearning♪

27:01.960 --> 27:05.720
♪Still vivid as our first meeting♪

27:06.950 --> 27:08.950
♪Endless gazing♪

27:09.530 --> 27:13.480
♪Step by step, falling deeper♪

27:13.480 --> 27:15.350
♪How to untangle this love♪

27:15.620 --> 27:21.120
♪Buried deep within dreams♪

27:22.300 --> 27:27.540
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

27:28.620 --> 27:29.620
Why have you come?

27:31.540 --> 27:32.540
I can't let you go.

27:33.620 --> 27:34.460
I can't get past it.

27:39.100 --> 27:40.020
I can't give you up.

27:43.050 --> 27:47.480
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

27:47.480 --> 27:51.370
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

27:51.900 --> 27:52.980
Then why did you

27:54.380 --> 27:55.900
come to see me only now?

27:58.300 --> 27:59.300
Is it still possible?

28:06.130 --> 28:12.380
♪In the vast world,
I searched for years♪

28:13.590 --> 28:19.340
♪Shadows hustle. Scenes reappear♪

28:19.340 --> 28:22.140
♪What is there to fear♪

28:22.140 --> 28:27.910
♪We'll weather storms together♪

28:29.260 --> 28:30.380
Of course it's not too late.

28:32.220 --> 28:33.500
No one can force me to do

28:34.580 --> 28:35.660
what I refuse to do

28:37.020 --> 28:38.580
or marry whom I refuse to marry.

28:39.410 --> 28:42.520
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

28:42.580 --> 28:44.020
I'm done with overthinking

28:45.460 --> 28:46.540
and hesitation.

28:48.780 --> 28:49.620
Now,

28:51.300 --> 28:52.820
I'm doing what I want.

28:53.750 --> 28:56.860
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

28:56.860 --> 28:58.140
I understand your struggles.

28:59.340 --> 29:00.460
You care for me,

29:01.500 --> 29:03.660
but how can you abandon your army?

29:04.860 --> 29:06.020
I've convinced His Majesty.

29:07.260 --> 29:08.140
I won't marry you

29:09.340 --> 29:10.620
or anyone else.

29:12.420 --> 29:14.300
With or without a marriage contract,

29:16.700 --> 29:17.540
He Yan,

29:19.220 --> 29:21.020
you're my chosen wife.

29:24.340 --> 29:25.340
And I choose you too.

29:27.920 --> 29:34.000
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

29:51.380 --> 29:57.090
(Happiness, Groom's Procession)

30:12.860 --> 30:13.860
I keep thinking

30:14.260 --> 30:15.100
you're still

30:15.100 --> 30:16.340
that naive young girl.

30:16.820 --> 30:17.660
But now,

30:18.020 --> 30:18.900
you're a bride.

30:21.260 --> 30:22.100
Yan,

30:23.020 --> 30:24.420
I'm suddenly scared.

30:24.460 --> 30:25.300
What should I do?

30:26.740 --> 30:27.660
After today,

30:28.020 --> 30:29.300
you'll have a new identity.

30:29.860 --> 30:30.700
It's natural

30:30.900 --> 30:32.060
to feel nervous.

30:34.100 --> 30:34.940
But Taotao,

30:36.460 --> 30:37.300
remember.

30:38.060 --> 30:38.980
Whether you are

30:39.220 --> 30:40.260
someone's wife

30:40.580 --> 30:41.500
or a mother,

30:42.620 --> 30:43.540
never forget

30:44.180 --> 30:45.700
that above all, you are yourself.

30:47.740 --> 30:49.220
Don't let any single identity

30:49.580 --> 30:50.420
confine you.

30:56.780 --> 30:57.740
I won't forget.

30:59.660 --> 31:01.020
I have my aspirations to pursue

31:01.980 --> 31:03.020
and books I want to write.

31:04.060 --> 31:05.540
Whether Cheng Lisu is with me or not,

31:06.340 --> 31:07.300
I'll see them through.

31:10.180 --> 31:11.380
Why the sudden tears?

31:11.900 --> 31:13.740
If you keep crying,
your makeup will smudge.

31:15.100 --> 31:16.580
It just occurred to me

31:17.740 --> 31:19.180
that if you wore bridal attire,

31:19.540 --> 31:20.940
you'd outshine everyone in Yaojing.

31:21.420 --> 31:22.700
Even more radiant than me.

31:23.940 --> 31:24.980
But now...

31:30.020 --> 31:32.020
Who cares about marriage?

31:32.860 --> 31:34.220
I'll still be a general,

31:34.580 --> 31:35.420
live my life,

31:35.780 --> 31:36.860
and enjoy my freedom.

31:37.900 --> 31:39.140
Alright, stop crying.

31:39.380 --> 31:41.740
Save those tears
for the wedding procession later.

31:49.860 --> 31:51.500
The bride alights from her sedan!

31:51.820 --> 31:53.980
Blessings descend!

31:55.620 --> 31:57.060
The couple enters the gate!

31:57.500 --> 31:59.540
Fortunes arrive!

32:10.300 --> 32:12.980
The star of fortune clears all paths!

32:13.380 --> 32:17.140
Step over the saddle for good omens!

32:22.940 --> 32:24.300
The bride crosses the saddle!

32:24.820 --> 32:26.900
May peace and wishes be granted!

32:28.460 --> 32:29.300
Come on.

32:36.580 --> 32:38.700
Step over the saddle!

32:49.900 --> 32:50.740
Cheng Lisu.

32:50.740 --> 32:51.580
Don't be angry.

32:51.580 --> 32:53.180
I just wanted to surprise you.

32:53.500 --> 32:54.340
See.

33:02.020 --> 33:03.860
Turning the felt like a scroll,

33:04.220 --> 33:06.980
joy yearns to be whole.

33:10.100 --> 33:11.340
Husband and wife turn the felt,

33:11.820 --> 33:13.540
may your house brim with descendants!

33:18.380 --> 33:20.220
Good fortune hides in the fans!

33:20.740 --> 33:23.500
Open them with a smile!

33:55.420 --> 33:56.780
Fans open!

33:57.260 --> 33:59.900
Flowers bloom with prosperity!

34:29.060 --> 34:31.060
First bow to heaven and earth!

34:39.179 --> 34:41.060
Second bow to the parents!

34:46.460 --> 34:48.219
Peace throughout the year!

34:53.980 --> 34:55.699
The couple bows to each other!

34:58.180 --> 34:59.980
A century of devotion!

35:01.300 --> 35:03.460
The ceremony is complete!

35:04.340 --> 35:05.540
- Congrats.
- Congrats.

35:06.380 --> 35:07.220
Congrats.

35:16.500 --> 35:18.140
Who told you to wear this?

35:19.980 --> 35:21.420
I think this pouch looks great.

35:23.420 --> 35:24.780
Just don't tell anyone

35:25.020 --> 35:26.180
that I embroidered it.

35:30.540 --> 35:31.380
Get up.

35:31.420 --> 35:32.260
Get up.

35:34.420 --> 35:35.780
Send the newlyweds

35:36.060 --> 35:37.820
to the bridal chamber!

35:40.340 --> 35:42.100
Having such a lively wedding

35:43.460 --> 35:44.300
is truly wonderful.

36:02.460 --> 36:03.300
Sorry.

36:06.620 --> 36:07.460
No.

36:08.340 --> 36:12.100
Many lovers in this world
never get together.

36:12.980 --> 36:14.140
At least, we, here and now,

36:14.820 --> 36:16.060
can hold hands.

36:16.900 --> 36:17.980
Even without marriage,

36:18.700 --> 36:20.180
we'll grow old together.

36:56.820 --> 36:57.820
Why aren't you eating?

36:58.260 --> 36:59.260
In this freezing weather,

36:59.380 --> 37:00.700
we should have lamb hotpot.

37:06.580 --> 37:07.740
General Feihong, eat a lot.

37:08.300 --> 37:09.140
Get stronger.

37:09.700 --> 37:10.540
Put on some weight.

37:11.660 --> 37:14.900
The world thinks slimness
makes women attractive.

37:15.340 --> 37:17.580
Why do you think differently?

37:17.820 --> 37:18.660
Others' opinions

37:19.180 --> 37:20.020
mean nothing to me.

37:20.620 --> 37:21.860
I only want you

37:22.100 --> 37:23.220
to be vigorous and healthy,

37:23.780 --> 37:26.300
so you can triumph on battlefields.

37:26.700 --> 37:28.500
That's what I like to hear.

37:28.980 --> 37:32.420
Here's to you, General Fengyun.

37:35.540 --> 37:36.380
General Feihong.

37:47.260 --> 37:48.100
They're sounding

37:48.900 --> 37:50.140
the drums at the beacon tower.

37:56.060 --> 37:56.900
Commander.

37:57.300 --> 37:58.140
Border alert.

37:58.580 --> 37:59.460
Wutuo attacks Mingshui

37:59.540 --> 38:00.740
and Huayuan simultaneously.

38:04.700 --> 38:06.340
No time to waste. Go to the palace now.

38:06.750 --> 38:08.910
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

38:09.010 --> 38:12.930
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

38:13.110 --> 38:15.050
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

38:15.140 --> 38:20.070
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

38:32.170 --> 38:33.580
♪I've seen the mountains♪

38:33.780 --> 38:35.190
♪And trodden through ice♪

38:35.460 --> 38:38.270
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

38:38.580 --> 38:39.970
♪Destiny is my creed♪

38:40.030 --> 38:41.430
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

38:41.580 --> 38:43.370
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

38:44.570 --> 38:46.040
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

38:46.210 --> 38:47.500
♪Gazing through the mire♪

38:47.680 --> 38:50.070
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

38:50.270 --> 38:52.320
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

38:53.450 --> 38:55.280
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

38:57.240 --> 39:00.160
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

39:00.250 --> 39:02.910
♪There must always be a longing♪

39:03.370 --> 39:08.430
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

39:08.760 --> 39:10.770
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

39:11.080 --> 39:14.730
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

39:14.970 --> 39:16.860
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

39:16.890 --> 39:20.740
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

39:21.090 --> 39:23.030
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

39:23.210 --> 39:27.040
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

39:27.290 --> 39:33.040
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

39:33.930 --> 39:39.400
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

39:46.560 --> 39:49.480
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

39:49.560 --> 39:52.230
♪There must always be a longing♪

39:52.680 --> 39:57.740
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

39:58.080 --> 40:00.090
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:00.400 --> 40:04.050
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:04.280 --> 40:06.170
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:06.200 --> 40:10.050
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:10.400 --> 40:12.340
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

40:12.530 --> 40:16.350
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

40:16.610 --> 40:22.360
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

40:23.250 --> 40:28.710
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪
